PackageIdentifier: Gridline.Gridline
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Gridline
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/lolitemaultes
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/lolitemaultes/Gridline/issues
PackageName: Gridline
PackageUrl: https://github.com/lolitemaultes/Gridline
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/lolitemaultes/Gridline/blob/main/LICENSE
ShortDescription: Pattern-based music workstation
Description: |-
  Gridline is a free, open source music workstation built around patterns. Sketch beats in the
  channel rack, write melodies and chords in the piano roll, arrange patterns, audio and automation
  in the playlist and mix everything on a full mixer. It hosts VST3, CLAP, VST2 and LV2 plugins,
  runs as a VST3 and CLAP plugin itself and supports live collaboration over the network.
Moniker: gridline
